      "side": 1,
      "message": "yeah, i\u0027m not the biggest fan either. but from what I can tell, there isn\u0027t a way to tell whether a file is ignored unless you run `clang-format` (without traversing the tree and implementing the ignore logic). this fix is a pragmatic path forward IMO until we see this has unintended side effects or should otherwise be improved",
